jobs.description:
Why Join WevSocial?

Joining WevSocial means working directly with the founder at the earliest stage, where your technical contributions will directly dictate our growth trajectory. As an intern, you will:

• Build the automated engines that drive our user acquisition and supply-side onboarding;

• Work closely with the founder on key business, product, and growth-engineering decisions;

• Gain rare startup experience across growth hacking, programmatic SEO, and marketplace liquidity;

• Take ownership of technical growth initiatives, not just administrative tasks;

• Learn how early-stage marketplaces achieve product-market fit and network effects;

• Have the opportunity to transition into a full-time Growth Engineer role as the company scales.

What You’ll Work On (Specific WEVSOCIAL Growth Tasks)

Depending on your strengths, you will build and execute technical growth strategies, including:

• Automated Supply-Side Acquisition (Solving the Cold Start): Write Python/Node.js scripts to scrape local directories, community boards, and social media to identify independent care providers, local tennis coaches, and indie event hosts in Toronto. Build automated, personalized cold-email and DM outreach sequences.

• Programmatic SEO & Local Discovery: Engineer a system to dynamically generate hundreds of localized, high-intent landing pages (e.g., "Elderly Companions in The Annex," "Pickup Basketball in Trinity Bellwoods") to capture local search traffic at scale.

• Growth Loops
